title: I want to read others more deeply.
pid: 7fbeb670-463d-442e-b90b-9817063d5465
body: |2-
  They give me the tiniest window into what they have thought.
  I have to think to ask it.
  It should just be mapped.
  Some of that map could be labeled private, that is fine.
  Just let me know what else there is I could know.
  I have infinite desire to know and instead I go in circles,
  let people repeat themselves to me, and vice versa*.

  \* fun in the more abstract sense but I mean I repeat
